{"language":"jp","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","噬身落种"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/jp","侵食の種"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","对敌人造成伤害并为其种下“吮噬心核”，“吮噬心核”会每隔一段时间攻击宿主并扣除他的能量。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/jp","敵にダメージを与え、「心食いの核」を植え付ける。「心食いの核」は一定時間ごとに宿主にダメージを与え、宿主のSPを減少させる"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","悉达瞬移到敌人面前，使其无法行动，对其造成共520% + 60% ATK伤害并吸收共220 + 20点能量，期间悉达处于霸体状态，随后在敌人身上种下“吮噬心核”。本技能优先对未种下“吮噬心核”的敌人使用。当“吮噬心核”的宿主被击败或悉达为已种下“吮噬心核”的敌人再次释放终极技能时，这枚“吮噬心核”会掉落在场上，且场上至多同时存在8个“吮噬心核”，在挑战首领的模式中，掉落在场上的“吮噬心核”不会阻挡角色。\n被动地，每2.5秒，“吮噬心核”对宿主造成250% ATK伤害，并扣除敌人120点能量。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","敵の前まで瞬間移動し、対象を行動不能にし、合計520% + 60% ATKのダメージを与え、220 + 20のSPを吸収。その間、自身はスーパーアーマー状態になる。その後、対象の敵に「心食いの核」を植え付ける。このスキルは優先的に「心食いの核」の宿主以外の敵を対象にする。「心食いの核」の宿主が撃破された時、または自身が「心食いの核」の宿主に向けて再度必殺技を発動する時、その宿主が持つ「心食いの核」はフィールド上に落ちる。フィールド上に同時に存在できる「心食いの核」は最大8個まで。ボス挑戦モードの場合、フィールド上の「心食いの核」はキャラクターの移動を妨げない\nパッシブ効果：「心食いの核」は2.5秒ごとに1回、宿主に250% ATKのダメージを与え、宿主のSPを120減少させる"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":26,"end":32,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":45,"end":50,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":27,"end":33,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":49,"end":54,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":22,"end":36,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":60,"end":62,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":225,"end":233,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":23,"end":37,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":68,"end":76,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":311,"end":319,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","造成共540% + 60% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","合計540% + 60% ATKのダメージを与える"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":13,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":6,"end":12,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":3,"end":17,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":2,"end":16,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","造成共560% + 60% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","合計560% + 60% ATKのダメージを与える"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":13,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":6,"end":12,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":3,"end":17,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":2,"end":16,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","造成共580% + 60% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","合計580% + 60% ATKのダメージを与える"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":13,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":6,"end":12,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":3,"end":17,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":2,"end":16,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","造成共600% + 60% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/jp","合計600% + 60% ATKのダメージを与える"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":13,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":6,"end":12,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":3,"end":17,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":2,"end":16,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","生机汲取"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/jp","生気吸収"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","被动地，造成伤害时会回复一定生命值，且溢出回复会转化为护盾；主动释放时，对敌人造成伤害，并且附近的“吮噬心核”也会一同对敌人造成伤害。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/jp","パッシブ効果：ダメージを与えた時、一定量のHPを回復。HP上限を超えた回復量はシールドに変換される。アクティブ効果：敵にダメージを与え、近くにある「心食いの核」も対象の敵にダメージを与える"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动地，悉达的普通攻击和技能造成伤害时，会额外回复等同于100%实际造成伤害量的生命值，且通过这个方式获得的生命回复时，超出生命上限的部分将会转化为护盾，该护盾的抵御值不会超过3000% + 300% ATK。\n主动释放时，将血刺刺入敌人体内，对其造成420% + 40% ATK伤害并造成打断效果。若该敌人1格范围内存在“吮噬心核”，则会进行一次协同攻击，对其造成30% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","パッシブ効果：自身の通常攻撃とスキルでダメージを与えた時、実際に与えたダメージ×100%分のHPを回復。HP上限を超えた回復量はシールドに変換される。シールド値は3000% + 300% ATKを超えない\nアクティブ効果：血の棘を敵の体内に刺し込み、420% + 40% ATKのダメージと中断効果を与える。対象の周囲1マス範囲内に「心食いの核」が存在する場合、「心食いの核」は連携攻撃を1回行い、その敵に30% ATKのダメージを与える"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":93,"end":100,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"},{"start":130,"end":136,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":86,"end":93,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"},{"start":129,"end":135,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":88,"end":104,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":126,"end":140,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":145,"end":149,"tooltip_key":"keyword:interrupteff"},{"start":183,"end":190,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":81,"end":97,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":125,"end":139,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":145,"end":149,"tooltip_key":"keyword:interrupteff"},{"start":203,"end":210,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至430% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが430% + 40% ATKにUP"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至440% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが440% + 40% ATKにUP"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至450% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが450% + 40% ATKにUP"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","复生之实"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/jp","復活の実"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","被击败时，消耗掉一枚“吮噬心核”重新复生。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/jp","自身が撃破された時、「心食いの核」を1個消費して復活"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","悉达被击败时，会消耗掉一枚“吮噬心核”，在其所处位置重新复生，并回复10% + 1% HP。本技能优先消耗存活最久的“吮噬心核”，且其每存活1秒，使悉达复生时额外回复2.5% HP，至多额外回复50% HP。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","自身が撃破された時、「心食いの核」を1個消費し、その核の場所で復活し、HPを10% + 1% HP回復。このスキルの発動時、優先的に生存時間が最も長い「心食いの核」を消費し、消費された「心食いの核」の生存時間1秒につき、追加で2.5% HPのHPを回復。追加のHP回復量は50% HPを超えない"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":37,"end":42,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":41,"end":46,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":34,"end":45,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":83,"end":90,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":97,"end":103,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":38,"end":49,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":113,"end":120,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":136,"end":142,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","“吮噬心核”每存活1秒，使悉达复生时额外回复3% HP，至多额外回复60% HP。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","消費された「心食いの核」の生存時間1秒につき、追加で3% HPのHPを回復。追加のHP回復量は60% HPを超えない"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":22,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":34,"end":40,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":26,"end":31,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":47,"end":53,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","“吮噬心核”每存活1秒，使悉达复生时额外回复3.5% HP，至多额外回复70% HP。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","消費された「心食いの核」の生存時間1秒につき、追加で3.5% HPのHPを回復。追加のHP回復量は70% HPを超えない"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":22,"end":29,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":36,"end":42,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":26,"end":33,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":49,"end":55,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","“吮噬心核”每存活1秒，使悉达复生时额外回复4% HP，至多额外回复80% HP。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","消費された「心食いの核」の生存時間1秒につき、追加で4% HPのHPを回復。追加のHP回復量は80% HPを超えない"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":22,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":34,"end":40,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":26,"end":31,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":47,"end":53,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/jp","天賦の才"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗中，受到伤害降低，每有1枚“吮噬心核”存活则受到伤害进一步降低。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、自身の被ダメージDOWN。生存中の「心食いの核」1個につき、追加で自身の被ダメージDOWN"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的受到的伤害降低12%，每有1枚“吮噬心核”存活，受到伤害额外降低2%，至多额外降低10%。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、自身の被ダメージ-12%。生存中の「心食いの核」1個につき、追加で自身の被ダメージ-2%。「心食いの核」による被ダメージ軽減量は最大10%まで"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的受到的伤害降低16%，每有1枚“吮噬心核”存活，受到伤害额外降低3%，至多额外降低15%。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、自身の被ダメージ-16%。生存中の「心食いの核」1個につき、追加で自身の被ダメージ-3%。「心食いの核」による被ダメージ軽減量は最大15%まで"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的受到的伤害降低20%，每有1枚“吮噬心核”存活，受到伤害额外降低4%，至多额外降低20%。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、自身の被ダメージ-20%。生存中の「心食いの核」1個につき、追加で自身の被ダメージ-4%。「心食いの核」による被ダメージ軽減量は最大20%まで"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","透体生根"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/jp","寄生強化"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","每次释放终极技能，提升“吮噬心核”的攻击频率。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/jp","必殺技を発動するたびに、「心食いの核」が宿主を攻撃する時間間隔が短縮される"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被“吮噬心核”寄生的敌人造成的伤害降低35%。悉达每释放1次终极技能，使本场战斗中“吮噬心核”攻击宿主的间隔降低0.5秒，至多降低1.5秒。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","「心食いの核」が植え付けられている敵の与ダメージ-35%。必殺技を1回発動するたびに、「心食いの核」が宿主を攻撃する時間間隔が永続的に-0.5秒、最大で-1.5秒まで"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","“吮噬心核”造成伤害提升至290% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","「心食いの核」のダメージが290% ATKにUP"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":13,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","“吮噬心核”造成伤害提升至330% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","「心食いの核」のダメージが330% ATKにUP"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":13,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","本技能降低“吮噬心核”攻击间隔的效果达到上限后，悉达对所有敌人造成1200% ATK伤害，并用血刺缠绕使他们无法行动。血刺会在敌人处于霸体期间缩回，并会在霸体结束后继续缠绕，且缠绕期间敌人每秒失去160% ATK的生命值。每名敌人缠绕的总时长至多为45秒。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","このスキルによる「心食いの核」の攻撃間隔を短縮する効果が上限に達した時、敵全体に1200% ATKのダメージを与え、血の棘で対象に束縛を45秒間付与。この束縛効果は対象がスーパーアーマー状態の間に解除され、スーパーアーマー状態終了後に再発動する。束縛状態の敵は、行動不能になり、毎秒160% ATKのHPを失う"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":33,"end":42,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":67,"end":69,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":77,"end":79,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":98,"end":106,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":40,"end":49,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":85,"end":93,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":103,"end":111,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":141,"end":149,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/jp","覚醒の力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","在战斗开始时，在周围的友军身上种下“吮噬心核”。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/jp","戦闘開始時、周囲の味方に「心食いの核」を植え付ける"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","在战斗开始时，在离自身最近的2名友方英雄身上种下“吮噬心核”，它们不会对友军发起攻击，并会在战斗开始时使这些友军获得抵御值为悉达的800% ATK的护盾。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","戦闘開始時、自身から最も近い味方英雄2体に「心食いの核」を植え付ける。「心食いの核」は味方を攻撃せず、戦闘開始時に対象の味方にシーダの800% ATK分のシールドを付与"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":65,"end":73,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":67,"end":75,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","猩红维管"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/jp","クリムゾン・ヴェイン"]]}